{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……马上就两个月了啊」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4926", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自从和新吾交往以来，时间就过得很快 。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一眨眼就两个月了。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过对我而言，每天都有新鲜的体验。", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感觉到现在也不像是一对恋人。", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生今天是休息对吧」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6616", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，感冒了。昨天傍晚开始发烧，\\n　咳嗽也有点厉害」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "「嗯，感冒了。昨天傍晚开始发烧，　咳嗽也有点厉害」", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7119", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天好转了很多，\\n　但是以防万一还是休息了」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「今天好转了很多，　但是以防万一还是休息了」", "plain_idx": 217, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7120", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这样啊……毕竟他一直都顶着寒冷的天气努力呢」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6617", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4928", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾在社团活动的时候，\\n一直都承包着室外的作业。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "新吾在社团活动的时候，一直都承包着室外的作业。", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "力气活也很多，\\n他说不想让我们女生感冒所以都独自承担了。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "力气活也很多，他说不想让我们女生感冒所以都独自承担了。", "plain_idx": 226, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果自己倒努力过头感冒了，\\n那家伙真是……", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "结果自己倒努力过头感冒了，那家伙真是……", "plain_idx": 228, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……在担心瓜生吗？」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6618", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那是。放着不管的话马上就会乱来，\\n　就算自己身体不好，\\n　也只会关心周围的人……」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "「那是。放着不管的话马上就会乱来，　就算自己身体不好，　也只会关心周围的人……」", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4929", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦，你很了解你的男朋友嘛」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6619", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你是在挖苦我吗？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4930", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不是啦。\\n　感觉你这么冷静，稍微有点意外」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": "「才不是啦。　感觉你这么冷静，稍微有点意外」", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6620", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「以你的性格，如果重要的瓜生感冒了，肯定……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": "「以你的性格，如果重要的瓜生感冒了，肯定……」", "plain_idx": 241, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6954", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想你肯定会慌慌张张的，\\n　因为担心过头引发骚乱之类的」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": "「我想你肯定会慌慌张张的，　因为担心过头引发骚乱之类的」", "plain_idx": 244, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6955", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7121", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算今天你自己也请假，坚持要陪在身边照顾他，\\n　我也不觉得奇怪……」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": "「就算今天你自己也请假，坚持要陪在身边照顾他，　我也不觉得奇怪……」", "plain_idx": 248, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6956", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理太天真了」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7122", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？为、为什么这么说？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6957", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「昨天傍晚传来消息说情况恶化了的时候，\\n　我早就大闹过了，之后立刻突击到了新吾的房间里」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": "「昨天傍晚传来消息说情况恶化了的时候，　我早就大闹过了，之后立刻突击到了新吾的房间里」", "plain_idx": 255, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7123", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果、果然如此呢。\\n　毕竟是你，会这么做也是意料之中……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "「果、果然如此呢。　毕竟是你，会这么做也是意料之中……」", "plain_idx": 258, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6958", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以是因为昨天探望之后稍微放心了，\\n　今天才自己一个人来上学了？」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": "「所以是因为昨天探望之后稍微放心了，　今天才自己一个人来上学了？」", "plain_idx": 261, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6959", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，正如你刚才所说，\\n　我本来也想休息之后陪在身边照顾他的……」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": "「不，正如你刚才所说，　我本来也想休息之后陪在身边照顾他的……」", "plain_idx": 264, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7124", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……原来如此，是瓜生不让你这样的对吧」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6960", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……他说虽然很高兴，\\n　但是不能为了他而休息……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": "「嗯……他说虽然很高兴，　但是不能为了他而休息……」", "plain_idx": 269, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7125", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天很早去探望了一番以后，看到他好多了，\\n意识也很清楚的时候……被他明确地拒绝了。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": "今天很早去探望了一番以后，看到他好多了，意识也很清楚的时候……被他明确地拒绝了。", "plain_idx": 272, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算感冒了，瓜生也还是始终如一呢」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6961", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没错。“这就是新吾啊”，我也这么想着接受了。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "没错。“这就是新吾啊”，我也这么想着接受了。", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是……", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理果然还是太天真了」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7126", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，哪里弄错了吗？」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6962", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊……那个，我可以稍微秀一下恩爱吗？」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7127", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……你都说到这份上了，\\n　我也没有听下去以外的选项了啊……呼」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "「……你都说到这份上了，　我也没有听下去以外的选项了啊……呼」", "plain_idx": 284, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6963", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然只有不好的预感，但是请说吧」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6623", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟你说啊！\\n　感冒之后弱弱的新吾真是太太太太太可爱了，\\n　我都想一口吃掉他了！」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "「我跟你说啊！　感冒之后弱弱的新吾真是太太太太太可爱了，　我都想一口吃掉他了！」", "plain_idx": 289, "len": 44, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4934", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道这么说有点不太好，\\n　但是那家伙一直以来都很可靠对吧？\\n　就会产生一种什么都想为他做的心情」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "「我知道这么说有点不太好，　但是那家伙一直以来都很可靠对吧？　就会产生一种什么都想为他做的心情」", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 52, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4935", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以就让人更想为他付出一切了，\\n　摸摸头之后那睡眼惺忪的样子，\\n　真是太太太可爱了！」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "「所以就让人更想为他付出一切了，　摸摸头之后那睡眼惺忪的样子，　真是太太太可爱了！」", "plain_idx": 295, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4936", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6624", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉。是我太得意忘形了」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4937", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然知道自己很吵，但还是想找个人倾诉一下。", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "太想让人知道新吾的事了，控制不住自己。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总觉得纱凪已经到了很远的地方呢」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6625", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么这么说？」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4938", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉你已经变成和我不一样的女生了。\\n　虽然大概是瓜生改变的吧……」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": "「感觉你已经变成和我不一样的女生了。　虽然大概是瓜生改变的吧……」", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6626", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理不交男朋友吗？」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4939", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「开玩笑。我可不会那么依赖男人」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6627", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那种事还挺让人害怕的」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6628", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明明要是爱理有那个想法的话，\\n肯定会有很多男生来搭讪的。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": "明明要是爱理有那个想法的话，肯定会有很多男生来搭讪的。", "plain_idx": 316, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过我也能理解她，\\n不会喜欢那种类型的男生。", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "不过我也能理解她，不会喜欢那种类型的男生。", "plain_idx": 318, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……能让爱理钟情的男生，会是什么样的人呢。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就我个人而言，对这个问题十分感兴趣。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再说，我现在已经听够了纱凪的炫耀」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6629", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算交往了，你也没有对他有什么不满吧。\\n　瓜生就这么完美吗……」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": "「就算交往了，你也没有对他有什么不满吧。　瓜生就这么完美吗……」", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6630", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么说呢……完美吗……」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4940", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不满……要说没有倒也不是……嗯。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比如想让他吃我的醋，接吻技术太过熟练之类的，\\n还有笑容太过温柔，抱住我的双手太过牢靠什么的。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "比如想让他吃我的醋，接吻技术太过熟练之类的，还有笑容太过温柔，抱住我的双手太过牢靠什么的。", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 47, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7128", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……要是把这些当作不满说出来，\\n感觉就真的要惹爱理生气了。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": "……要是把这些当作不满说出来，感觉就真的要惹爱理生气了。", "plain_idx": 333, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不如说我自己也感觉，现在想的这些不是不满，\\n而只是在秀恩爱吧？", "text_idx": 334, "plain": "不如说我自己也感觉，现在想的这些不是不满，而只是在秀恩爱吧？", "plain_idx": 335, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "换句话说，我对新吾没有不满？", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不对，但是新吾应该也不是\\n完美的男友吧……大概……", "text_idx": 337, "plain": "不对，但是新吾应该也不是完美的男友吧……大概……", "plain_idx": 338, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸，瓜生是草食系的啦～」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0022", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然是这样吗？\\n　喂喂，纱凪。那方面情况如何？」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": "「果然是这样吗？　喂喂，纱凪。那方面情况如何？」", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jx0009", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸，刚刚在说什么？」", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4941", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然被人搭了话，我和爱理面面相觑。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "是一群总是拿着女性杂志，\\n聊着没头没脑的话题的学生。", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "是一群总是拿着女性杂志，聊着没头没脑的话题的学生。", "plain_idx": 350, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很久以前她们给我看的\\n《不想和这种女孩交往排行榜》\\n事到如今也还是我的心理创伤。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": "很久以前她们给我看的《不想和这种女孩交往排行榜》事到如今也还是我的心理创伤。", "plain_idx": 352, "len": 42, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「杂志里写到了草食系情侣的话题」", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0023", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生果然是草食系的吧？」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0024", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我有听过这个话题。", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "据说最近不过分和女孩亲密接触，\\n和异性友好相处，就像草食动物般稳重的男生\\n变多了。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": "据说最近不过分和女孩亲密接触，和异性友好相处，就像草食动物般稳重的男生变多了。", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "反过来就是肉食系。", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不恋爱就活不下去的女生似乎也属于肉食系。", "text_idx": 361, "plain": "不恋爱就活不下去的女生似乎也属于肉食系。", "plain_idx": 361, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉和瓜生待在一起就能让人安心呢」", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jx0010", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那是……确实……」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7129", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这么一说，\\n我也没有被他毛手毛脚过……也是啊。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": "这么一说，我也没有被他毛手毛脚过……也是啊。", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾一直都很温柔……不，\\n虽然偶尔也会恶作剧……", "text_idx": 368, "plain": "新吾一直都很温柔……不，虽然偶尔也会恶作剧……", "plain_idx": 369, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而那也都是之后温柔甜蜜的爱情表现的前奏……\\n所以说到底都不算是恶作剧。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": "而那也都是之后温柔甜蜜的爱情表现的前奏……所以说到底都不算是恶作剧。", "plain_idx": 371, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……原来刚才\\n心里有个坎一直过不去，就是这个问题啊。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": "……原来刚才心里有个坎一直过不去，就是这个问题啊。", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在一起虽然让人非常非——常安心。", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是再毛手毛脚一点不也挺好的嘛。\\n一点儿也不动手，有时就会感觉不够尽兴……", "text_idx": 375, "plain": "但是再毛手毛脚一点不也挺好的嘛。一点儿也不动手，有时就会感觉不够尽兴……", "plain_idx": 376, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｅ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是啊，男人不主动追求这些的话，\\n　对女人而言不也有点心情复杂吗？」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": "「但是啊，男人不主动追求这些的话，　对女人而言不也有点心情复杂吗？」", "plain_idx": 378, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jz0025", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｅ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "结女校学生Ｆ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊——有的有的。\\n　只有两个人在房间里，就算产生了那种氛围，\\n　也还是一脸平静的话多少有点……」", "text_idx": 380, "plain": "「啊——有的有的。　只有两个人在房间里，就算产生了那种氛围，　也还是一脸平静的话多少有点……」", "plain_idx": 381, "len": 51, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_jx0011", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｆ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4943", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "越是听下去，\\n我越是确信新吾就是草食系的了。", "text_idx": 384, "plain": "越是听下去，我越是确信新吾就是草食系的了。", "plain_idx": 385, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "基本都是我一味地索求接吻，\\n就算两个人在一起，我也只是被逗逗而已。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": "基本都是我一味地索求接吻，就算两个人在一起，我也只是被逗逗而已。", "plain_idx": 387, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且……还有一个惊人的事实。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然只是因为接吻就满足了，\\n导致我完全忘记了这茬……但是我……", "text_idx": 389, "plain": "虽然只是因为接吻就满足了，导致我完全忘记了这茬……但是我……", "plain_idx": 390, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——自从平安夜的第一次以后，再也没有被他渴求过！", "text_idx": 391, "plain": "——自从平安夜的第一次以后，再也没有被他渴求过！", "plain_idx": 391, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不仅如此，新吾连一点色色的事情都不做。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "之前谈到胸碰到手臂的时候也是……回想起来，\\n新吾好像也早早地结束了话题……！", "text_idx": 393, "plain": "之前谈到胸碰到手臂的时候也是……回想起来，新吾好像也早早地结束了话题……！", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这，这，这莫非是——", "text_idx": 395, "plain": "这，这，这莫非是——", "plain_idx": 395, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱、爱理，怎么办！我该怎么办！」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7130", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、等下，纱、纱凪……？！」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6964", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我像相扑选手一样一边吆喝着，\\n一边推着爱理——不对，是带着爱理来到了走廊。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": "我像相扑选手一样一边吆喝着，一边推着爱理——不对，是带着爱理来到了走廊。", "plain_idx": 401, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "借着这股气势——", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我有不满！超级不满！怎么办啊爱理？！\\n　新吾不索求我的肉体啊……！」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": "「我有不满！超级不满！怎么办啊爱理？！　新吾不索求我的肉体啊……！」", "plain_idx": 404, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7131", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪？！你、你稍微冷静一点！」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6965", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么可能冷静得下——唔咕」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": "「怎么可能冷静得下——唔咕」", "plain_idx": 408, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7132", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别在走廊大声说这种事情啊」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6966", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……是」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7133", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我点点头，爱理便把堵住我嘴巴的手拿走了。", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后把手放在连同性都羡慕的纤细的腰上，\\n叹了一口气。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": "然后把手放在连同性都羡慕的纤细的腰上，叹了一口气。", "plain_idx": 416, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之，那个，我明白你的意思了」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6967", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦哦，不愧是爱理，理解得真快，帮大忙了……\\n　那、那我到底应该怎么办……」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": "「哦哦，不愧是爱理，理解得真快，帮大忙了……　那、那我到底应该怎么办……」", "plain_idx": 420, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7134", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管怎么说，这个……不，虽然我也不太清楚，\\n　但应该没什么奇怪的，很正常吧？」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": "「不管怎么说，这个……不，虽然我也不太清楚，　但应该没什么奇怪的，很正常吧？」", "plain_idx": 423, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6968", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我觉得并不是所有男性都只追求女性的身体，\\n　不如说瓜生这样才像他，值得安心和信赖啊——」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": "「我觉得并不是所有男性都只追求女性的身体，　不如说瓜生这样才像他，值得安心和信赖啊——」", "plain_idx": 426, "len": 46, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6969", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一点都不普通。怎么可能安心啊」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7135", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是从交往开始一直都是柏拉图式的恋爱关系的话，\\n倒也不是不能理解爱理说的话……", "text_idx": 430, "plain": "要是从交往开始一直都是柏拉图式的恋爱关系的话，倒也不是不能理解爱理说的话……", "plain_idx": 431, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我们不是这样的！\\n早就体验过了！就在去年的平安夜！", "text_idx": 432, "plain": "但是我们不是这样的！早就体验过了！就在去年的平安夜！", "plain_idx": 433, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "新吾，那个时候他对我热情如火……完全变成了一个男人……", "text_idx": 434, "plain": "新吾，那个时候他对我热情如火……完全变成了一个男人……", "plain_idx": 434, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从那以后，至今为止大约两个月，\\n突然再也不像那时候一样了——", "text_idx": 435, "plain": "从那以后，至今为止大约两个月，突然再也不像那时候一样了——", "plain_idx": 436, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾是冷静下来之后就注意到了吗？\\n　注意到我作为女生一点魅力也没有……」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": "「新吾是冷静下来之后就注意到了吗？　注意到我作为女生一点魅力也没有……」", "plain_idx": 438, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7136", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，是胸部吗，是胸部的问题吧。\\n　新吾果然是觉得不够尽兴吧……呜哇」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": "「啊，是胸部吗，是胸部的问题吧。　新吾果然是觉得不够尽兴吧……呜哇」", "plain_idx": 441, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn7137", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，那个，说起胸部的话我也没什么起伏……和纱凪大差不差啦……」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": "「不，那个，说起胸部的话我也没什么起伏……和纱凪大差不差啦……」", "plain_idx": 443, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6970", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不、不做点什么的话……就糟了！", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱、纱凪？你在听吗？」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6971", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正因为新吾是草食系，\\n这样下去……第一次就要变成最后一次了……", "text_idx": 448, "plain": "正因为新吾是草食系，这样下去……第一次就要变成最后一次了……", "plain_idx": 449, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不要！我不要这样啊！\\n女生果然还是想要被喜欢的人追求一切啊……", "text_idx": 450, "plain": "我不要！我不要这样啊！女生果然还是想要被喜欢的人追求一切啊……", "plain_idx": 451, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正因为新吾一直以来都很温柔，毛手毛脚的程度倒也不至于，\\n但也希望他能追求比接吻更进一步的事情啊——", "text_idx": 452, "plain": "正因为新吾一直以来都很温柔，毛手毛脚的程度倒也不至于，但也希望他能追求比接吻更进一步的事情啊——", "plain_idx": 453, "len": 50, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "既然如此！", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那、那个……纱凪？」", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar6972", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理，我决定了！」", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4948", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「决定了什么？」", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6634", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我从今天开始就要做肉食系女生了！！」", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4949", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route07_06.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、欸欸——？！」", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_ar6635", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
